WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.987
Let’s walk through Complete the administration loop.

00:00:02.987 --> 00:00:07.200
Reconcile session identity, roster, plugin state, unresolved

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.037
issues, and required exports as one handoff package.

00:00:11.037 --> 00:00:14.175
Another operator should be able to continue without guessing which

00:00:14.175 --> 00:00:16.438
run or evidence set you meant.

00:00:16.438 --> 00:00:19.550
On this slide, before operator handoff, reconcile the

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:23.200
selected session, participant roster, plugin state, and

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.837
required exports.

00:00:25.385 --> 00:00:29.610
In practice, game Master owns administration and evidence continuity

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:29.748
;

00:00:29.748 --> 00:00:33.398
White Cell owns live run control and adjudication.

00:00:33.398 --> 00:00:36.260
Before you continue, verify these points:

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:38.823
State the selected session during handoff.

00:00:38.823 --> 00:00:42.260
Record unresolved participant or plugin issues.

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:45.685
Start Here remains available above the session label.

00:00:45.685 --> 00:00:49.235
Use the highlighted Session reference area as your visual reference

00:00:49.235 --> 00:00:50.935
while you complete this check.
